# The Weight of Your Limits (bastok 66): the offer without the axe. GreatAxe 2400: 790 (once per zone); its finish with a full
# inventory (no axe: giveItem false, not begun); a second talk in the zone falls to the default 604 (oncePerZone:
# priority Ignore); after a rezone 790 again and begun (the axe and the guide); then 791 with the axe held (hide 1)
# and its option 1 (the axe held: nothing).
lists Metalworks/Iron_Eater/onTrigger Metalworks/onEventFinish/790 Metalworks/onEventFinish/791
char zone=Metalworks pos=92,-19.6,2 job=WAR lvl=75
skill GreatAxe 2400
login
trigger Iron_Eater                    # 790 (oncePerZone)
fill-inventory
finish                         # no axe, the inventory full: giveItem false, not begun
free-inventory
trigger Iron_Eater                    # 790 already played in this zone: priority Ignore, the default 604
finish
rezone
trigger Iron_Eater                    # after the rezone: 790 again
finish                         # the axe (0 points) and the Weapon Training Guide: accepted
trigger Iron_Eater                    # the axe held: 791 with hide 1
finish option=1                # option 1, the axe held: nothing
